  m_Name: RelatedDescription_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b45308676d719ea44bc898aea4898950, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1
    m_Localized: 3 Durability. When the holder takes 50 or more DMG, Baron Bunny
      blocks it and loses 1 Durability. Vanishes when its Durability is depleted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11512500209799168
    m_Localized: An Outrider of the Knights of Favonius and Mondstadt's Gliding Champion.
      Her endless energy makes her a trustworthy companion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26802933513924608
    m_Localized: "\xB7Stacks up to {BaseStackLimit}\n\xB7At each turn end, deals
      {AuraDamagePercent} Cryo DMG to enemies within {AuraRadius} tile of the holder\n\xB7Shatters
      when the holder's Energy exceeds {ShatterEnergyThreshold}, healing the holder
      for {ShatterHealPercent} per shard\n\xB7Persists even if the holder is downed"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26802933564256256
    m_Localized: "\xB7Single stack\n\xB7At each turn end, deals {AuraDamagePercent}
      Hydro DMG to enemies within {AuraRadius} tile of the holder\n\xB7At each turn
      end, heals allies within {AuraRadius} tile for {AuraHealPercent} of the applier,
      grants them {AuraEnergyGain} Energy, restores {AuraSanityGain} Sanity and applies
      Hydro to them\n\xB7Vanishes when the holder is downed"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26802933564256257
    m_Localized: Only one may exist at a time; initially marks Lisa herself. When
      the holder takes enemy DMG, lightning strikes the attacker's position, dealing
      30% of the holder's ATK as Electro DMG to enemies within 1 tile, once per turn.
      Lisa's Enso transfers it to the coordinated ally; returns to Lisa if the holder
      vanishes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26802933564256258
    m_Localized: At each turn end, pulls enemies within 3 tiles 1 tile toward the
      field and deals 50% ATK Anemo DMG; grants allied characters a shield of 20%
      ATK and 5 Tenacity. Extends Dandelion Wind duration by 1 turn. Lasts 3 turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26802933564256259
    m_Localized: Up to 3 swords. When an allied character deals Skill DMG, consumes
      1 Rain Sword to deal 40% ATK Hydro DMG to the target (coordinated DMG). Cleared
      when the holder is downed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37301200798429184
    m_Localized: "\xB7The holder's ATK is increased by {BonusPerStack}\n\xB7Stacks
      up to {StackLimit} times\n\xB7Lasts {DurationTurns}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37301200819400704
    m_Localized: "\xB7The holder's Move SPD is increased by {BonusPerStack}\n\xB7Stacks
      up to {StackLimit} times, duration extends with each stack\n\xB7Lasts {DurationTurns}
      turns"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37631287712362496
    m_Localized: "\xB7The holder's DEF is decreased by {BonusPerStack}\n\xB7Stacks
      up to {StackLimit} times\n\xB7Lasts {DurationTurns}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37633262277439488
    m_Localized: "\xB7The holder's DEF is decreased by {BonusPerStack}\n\xB7Stacks
      up to {StackLimit} times\n\xB7Lasts {DurationTurns}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
